  "description": "Wild summer orange flowers with rose gold wire frames clipart. Watercolor wedding invitation & shower printable templates, floral borders. Printable art, home and wall decor. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.\nAll vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.\nWith this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:\n8 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)\n8 JPG files\n8 SVG files\n1 Ai file (vector format)\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements\n1 PDF file\n1 DXF file\nNo logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.\nFiles are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.",
